  unitName: Thunder Sentinel Deimos
  unitId: 840255
  unitNumber: 8130
  description: 'Like Zedus, the leader of the demigods, Deimos had a strong affinity
    to the element of Thunder. But where Zedus was ambitious and charismatic, Deimos
    was quite the opposite. Even amongst the demigods themselves Deimos came across
    most of them as an oddity. By nature, demigods were born with a great thirst
    for knowledge and power. They satiated this thirst in many different ways: by
    the way of the sword, by scientific development, or by the development of magical
    techniques. Deimos desired peace and harmony above all else. A kindhearted pacifist
    Deimos might have been, but there was one truth all demigods agreed upon. In
    terms of raw physical power, Deimos stood above every other demigod.'
  summonDesc: I am Deimos. Who might you be?<br>You look promising.<br>Will you aid
    us?
  fusionDesc: What a strange power...<br>I can feel it coursing through my body!
